sequenceDiagram
participant A0 as Runner
participant A1 as TestScope
participant A2 as Browser
participant A3 as Cleanup
participant A4 as Result
A0->>A1: construct scope; browser starts lazily
A0->>A2: execute page action and assertions
A0->>A1: CompleteAsync(outcome)
A1->>A2: if failed: capture screenshot and page HTML
A1->>A3: dispose: callbacks in reverse registration order
A3-->>A1: collect failures; continue remaining callbacks
A1->>A2: dispose every owned driver
A1->>A1: dispose API and token resources
A1->>A4: write result; cleanup failure means Failed
A1-->>A0: surface cleanup failure when present
